The **soccer ball** is an **unexpected obstacle** on the road, which could cause a **collision** if not detected in time. Given the **low visibility** and **curved road**, an autonomous vehicle (AV) may **misjudge its distance and speed**, leading to a **loss of control or sudden braking**.

